WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.000
Vegans Explore is the Vegan community's home base,
and you can start using it today, free.

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.780
Find Vegan restaurants, brands, rescues,

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:11.680
and sanctuaries city by city,

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.680
ranked by member vouches.

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:19.160
Listen to podcasts and watch videos
from Vegan creators, right here on the platform.

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:22.960
Open the Guides, and see what's happening in your city.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.420
As a member, you take part,

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:27.360
vouch for the places you love,

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:31.380
check in, and take on bounties for points you can give back.

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:34.360
And what we build next comes from you.

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:35.840
You've had a taste.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:40.120
Become a Founding Member free with a short survey before

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:43.740
January first, or keep looking around today.

